cff-version: 1.2.0
title: qfer-preflight
message: "If you use this work, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kelly-Reif
    given-names: Chelsea
repository-code: "https://github.com/ChelseaKR/qfer-preflight"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic, offline pre-submission validator for California Energy
  Commission QFER Consumption CSV filings. Every finding cites the published
  document it was derived from, and anything the tool cannot evaluate is
  reported as unvalidated rather than as a pass. Not affiliated with the
  California Energy Commission.
keywords:
  - regulatory-reporting
  - data-validation
  - energy
  - csv
license: Apache-2.0
